# Unswerving Sloth (5/5 Mount, Saddle 4): "Whenever this creature attacks while saddled, it gains indestructible until end of turn.
# Untap all creatures you control." On turn 3 the freshly cast Su-Chi (power 4, exactly the total power needed) is tapped to saddle the Sloth
# (CR 702.171a; a creature can saddle while summoning sick). The Sloth and Ornithopter attack; the trigger gives the Sloth
# indestructible and untaps the attacking Ornithopter (tapped by attacking) and the Su-Chi (tapped to saddle).

